Sample Array: {8, 61, 2, 3, 4, 0}

1. Why is extra memory required?

Merge Sort creates a temporary array while merging two sorted subarrays. Therefore, it needs extra memory.

Auxiliary Space Complexity: O(N)

2. Comparison with In-place Sorting
Algorithm	Space Complexity
Merge | Sort | O(N)
Insertion | Sort |	O(1)
Selection | Sort |	O(1)
Iterative | Quick Sort |	O(log N) (average stack usage)
